{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/f1696f2818e77fc38602342c81a7e7b3.poster.avif?t=1760423208\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/f1696f2818e77fc38602342c81a7e7b3.webm?t=1760423208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/f1696f2818e77fc38602342c81a7e7b3.mp4?t=1760423208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RESEED</strong> is a puzzle platformer that tests both your skill and your memory. Your goal: guide each seed safely to the end of the level. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The twist? While planning your route, the traps are hidden. You will need to remember their locations from memory and plan a safe path if you want the seed to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/982b37896bd185e102209ecdb00eee0d.webp?t=1760423208\" width=616 height=44 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Memorize the location of traps and plan a safe route to guide each seed safely to the end of the level. Precision and memory are your best tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/29340acb0085bb57106776adeae25640.poster.avif?t=1760423208\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/29340acb0085bb57106776adeae25640.webm?t=1760423208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/29340acb0085bb57106776adeae25640.mp4?t=1760423208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/ee6b133af99ab81f6fc6cbb5b48bdaf3.webp?t=1760423208\" width=616 height=44 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   Success won\u2019t come on your first try. Learn from each mistake, refine your memory, and perfect your route as levels grow increasingly complex with new traps and mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/415e67620d403c9535490f4e41f7e770.poster.avif?t=1760423208\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/415e67620d403c9535490f4e41f7e770.webm?t=1760423208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/415e67620d403c9535490f4e41f7e770.mp4?t=1760423208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/3a38e273cef9658158d2d822fb9a9b47.webp?t=1760423208\" width=616 height=44 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect golden seeds throughout the levels to unlock special missions and discover unique gameplay twists that will put your skills to test.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/61e131cd56faa5db942d287e8ff4f5c4.poster.avif?t=1760423208\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/61e131cd56faa5db942d287e8ff4f5c4.webm?t=1760423208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/61e131cd56faa5db942d287e8ff4f5c4.mp4?t=1760423208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/c05e175dde6f2cee71280c38279d24c2.webp?t=1760423208\" width=616 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue every seed and bring them back to your ship to complete your mission!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/b368d6682e043d5e6d8df8d64d803212.poster.avif?t=1760423208\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/b368d6682e043d5e6d8df8d64d803212.webm?t=1760423208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/b368d6682e043d5e6d8df8d64d803212.mp4?t=1760423208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/3ccb92ea18cd893665ba514306f4d188.apng?t=1760423208\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/3ccb92ea18cd893665ba514306f4d188.poster.avif?t=1760423208\" class=\"bb_img\" width=115 height=137 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Look how cute\u2026 want to adopt one